mit a game</a><a class="text-ink-2 hover:text-ink-strong md:hidden " aria-label="Search" href="/en/games"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 " aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 19a8 8 0 1 1 0-16 8 8 0 0 1 0 16Zm10 2-4.35-4.35"></path></svg></a><button type="button" class="-mr-1 p-1 text-ink-2 hover:text-ink-strong lg:hidden" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 " aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Menu</span></button></div></div></header><main id="main"><article class="container-page py-8"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":["VideoGame","SoftwareApplication"],"name":"Sudoku Unlimited","alternateName":[],"description":"Sudoku Unlimited is a sudoku game set in a cozy garden. Besides classic grids it has variants with irregular regions, sum cages, arrows and thermometers, and a garden journey that runs from small 4×4 boards up to full 9×9 puzzles. You can pencil in candidates, undo moves and ask for hints that explain the deduction, and guided lessons and exercises teach solving techniques. There is a daily puzzle, a generator for fresh classic boards at several difficulty levels and a separate collection of 140 puzzles; solving unlocks scenery, board palettes, music, decorations and visitors. Two players can share one board in online co-op using a room code, or play a points contest, and a Desktop Companion Mode puts the current puzzle in a small window you can pin on top of other apps. The developer's Steam AI disclosure says Claude Code was used to create the game's code and its assets. A paid game on Steam for Windows, released 21 Oct 2026, with its interface in 32 languages.","url":"https://vibegamedb.com/en/games/sudoku-unlimited","inLanguage":"en","image":"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/cover.webp","screenshot":["https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-1.webp","https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-2.webp","https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-3.webp","https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-4.webp"],"genre":["Puzzle","Casual"],"gamePlatform":["Steam"],"applicationCategory":"GameApplication","datePublished":"2026-10-21","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Pinch Games","url":"https://vibegamedb.com/en/developers/pinch-games"},"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","price":4.99,"priceCurrency":"USD","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-meta text-ink-3"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-ink-strong" href="/en">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink-4">/</span><a class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-ink-strong" href="/en/games">Discover</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink-4">/</span><span aria-current="page" class="text-ink-2">Sudoku Unlimited</span></li></ol></nav><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://vibegamedb.com/en"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Discover","item":"https://vibegamedb.com/en/games"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Sudoku Unlimited","item":"https://vibegamedb.com/en/games/sudoku-unlimited"}]}</script><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[340px_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8"><div class="cover-frame aspect-[1