ap text-estimated border-estimated/40"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 " aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 5 6v5c0 4.4 3 8.3 7 10 4-1.7 7-5.6 7-10V6l-7-3Z"></path></svg>Partially verified</span></div><div class="card divide-y divide-line"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start"><div class="flex w-48 shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-[5px] border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium leading-4 whitespace-nowrap border-line bg-surface-2 text-ink hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink-strong" href="/en/tools/claude-code">Claude Code</a><span class="text-[12px] text-fg-faint">Primary</span></div><div class="flex-1"><p class="text-[14px] text-fg">The developer&#x27;s Steam AI disclosure, in full: “I have used Claude Code to create the game itself code and assets.” It does not say which assets, whether any code or assets were made by hand, or how much.</p><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-fg-faint"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-[5px] border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium leading-4 whitespace-nowrap border-reported/35 text-reported bg-transparent" title="Stated publicly by the developer (devlog, post or interview). Not audited."><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true"></span>Developer Reported</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:text-fg hover:underline">Sudoku Unlimited on Steam</a></div></div></div></div><div class="card mt-4 p-4"><div class="mb-1 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Development approach</div><p class="text-[14.5px] text-fg">Not described beyond the one-sentence Steam disclosure, which says Claude Code was used to create the game&#x27;s code and assets. The store page lists online co-op through room codes, Steam leaderboards and achievements, and an offline solo mode.</p><dl class="mt-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Engine / framework</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg">Not disclosed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Languages</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Team size</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Development time</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Development cost</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-line py-2.5 last:border-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-[13px] text-fg-faint">AI-written code</dt><dd class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[14px]"><span class="text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</span></dd></div></dl></div><figure class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-4"><blockquote lang="en" class="text-[16px] italic text-fg">“<!-- -->I have used Claude Code to create the game itself code and assets.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-1 text-[12.5px] text-fg-faint">— <!-- -->Pinch Games<!-- -->, <!-- -->Sudoku Unlimited on Steam</figcaption></figure><p class="mt-4 text-[12.5px] text-fg-faint"><span class="text-fg-muted">Verification notes:</span> <!-- -->The AI claim rests on one sentence, the developer-written AI disclosure on the game&#x27;s Steam page (re-read on 4 Nov 2026): “I have used Claude Code to create the game itself code and assets.” It names Claude Code for both the code and the assets but gives no share and no detail. Steam lists Pinch Games as developer and publisher and no website; no devlog or social post was found. The same developer released Jigsaw Puzzles Complete on Steam on 27 Oct 2026 (not checked for this record). Release date, price, platform and languages from the Steam store API; the review count from the store page on 4 Nov 2026. No AI content generated during play is described.</p></section><section id="history" aria-labelledby="history-h" class="scroll-mt-20"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="history-h" class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-fg">Development history</h2></div><ol class="relative ml-2 space-y-5 border-l border-line pl-5"><li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="text-[12.5px] font-medium text-fg-muted"><time dateTime="2026-10-21">Oct 21, 2026</time></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-fg">Released on Steam for Windows at US$4.99.</p><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-fg-faint"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-[5px] border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium leading-4 whitespace-nowrap border-official/35 text-official bg-transparent" title="Published by the platform or publisher in an official statement."><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true"></span>Official</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:text-fg hover:underline">Steam</a></div></li></ol></section><section id="performance" aria-labelledby="performance-h" class="scroll-mt-20"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="performance-h" class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-fg">Game performance</h2></div><p class="mb-4 max-w-3xl text-[13px] text-fg-muted">Each figure measures something different — concurrent players, owners, downloads and sales are never interchangeable and are never added together. Labels show where each number comes from.</p><div class="space-y-6"><div class="card p-4"><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-fg">Steam</h3><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-fg-faint"><span>Released</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><a class="hover:text-fg hover:underline" href="/en/pricing/paid">$4.99</a><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">Store page</a></div></div><p class="mb-3 text-[12.5px] text-fg-faint">US$4.99 on the Steam store API on 4 Nov 2026. Windows only.</p><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-bg/40 p-3.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="text-[12.5px] text-fg-muted" title="Total user reviews on the Steam store page.">Steam reviews</div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-[5px] border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium leading-4 whitespace-nowrap border-observed/35 text-observed bg-transparent" title="Snapshot taken by us from a public page on the date shown."><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true"></span>Observed</span></div><div class="tnum mt-1.5 font-mono text-[22px] font-semibold text-fg">5</div><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11.5px] text-fg-faint"><span>as of Nov 4, 2026</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="hover:text-fg hover:underline">Steam</a></div><p class="mt-1.5 text-[11.5px] leading-4 text-fg-faint">All reviews as shown on the store page on 4 Nov 2026; Steam shows no score until a game has 10 reviews.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-bg/40 p-3.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="text-[12.5px] text-fg-muted" title="Highest number of people playing at the same moment. Not a count of players or sales.">All-time peak concurrent players</div></div><div class="tnum mt-1.5 font-mono text-[14px] text-fg-faint">Not disclosed</div><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11.5px] text-fg-faint"></div></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-[12px] text-fg-faint">Not publicly available: Concurrent players, Positive Steam reviews, Estimated owners, Copies sold, Gross revenue.</p></div></div></section><section id="reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-h" class="scroll-mt-20"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="reviews-h" class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-fg">Reviews &amp; rankings</h2></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="card p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-fg">Editorial review</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-[13.5px] text-fg-muted">Not yet reviewed by our editors.</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="card p-4"><div class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-fg">Ranking positions</div><p class="mt-2 text-[13.5px] text-fg-muted">Not currently ranked.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-h" class="scroll-mt-20"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="so