uts the current puzzle in a small window you can pin on top of other apps. The developer's Steam AI disclosure says Claude Code was used to create the game's code and its assets. A paid game on Steam for Windows, released 21 Oct 2026, with its interface in 32 languages.\",\"url\":\"https://vibegamedb.com/en/games/sudoku-unlimited\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"image\":\"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/cover.webp\",\"screenshot\":[\"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-1.webp\",\"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-2.webp\",\"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-3.webp\",\"https://vibegamedb.com/media/games/sudoku-unlimited/screenshot-4.webp\"],\"genre\":[\"Puzzle\",\"Casual\"],\"gamePlatform\":[\"Steam\"],\"applicationCategory\":\"GameApplication\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-21\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pinch Games\",\"url\":\"https://vibegamedb.com/en/developers/pinch-games\"},\"offers\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":4.99,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5354400/\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}],\"isAccessibleForFree\":false}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"container-page py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$17\"}}],\"$undefined\",[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"mb-4 text-meta text-ink-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/\",{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1.5\",\"children\":[false,[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"href\":\"/en\",\"className\":\"transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-ink-strong\",\"children\":\"Home\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/games\",{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-h